# GTA IV -> "The Cousins Bellic": Niko and Roman in the taxi at the docks.
#
# This title will NOT boot to a playable state without a controller present:
# with --hid=nop and no --input_script it stops at "Please reconnect
# controller" forever. The scripted driver only registers when a script is
# given, so this file is a prerequisite, not a convenience.
#
# Boot to the opening cinematic takes ~45s on this machine (measured: CPU
# climbs 108 -> 348% over the first minute and the cinematic is still running
# at t=135s, so it does not end on its own in a useful window). A skips it.
45000 -
120  A
2500 -
120  A
2500 -
120  A
2500 -
120  A
900000 -
